[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:22.91]I was standing by the Nile
[00:22.91]我站在尼罗河畔
[00:28.23]When I saw the lady smile.
[00:28.23]望着那位女士面含微笑
[00:33.50]I would take her out for a while,
[00:33.50]我会带她出去找点乐子
[00:37.40]For a while.
[00:37.40]找点乐子
[00:44.20]Light tears wept like a child.
[00:44.20]她泪光盈盈像个孩子
[00:49.43]How her golden hair was blowing wild.
[00:49.43]金黄的头发任凭狂风吹散
[00:54.86]Then she spread her wings to fly,
[00:54.86]然后展翅高飞
[00:58.83]For to fly.
[00:58.83]只为了飞走
[01:05.75]Soaring high above the breezes,
[01:05.75]乘着清风扶摇直上
[01:10.87]Going always where she pleases.
[01:10.87]去她想去的任何地方
[01:16.25]She will make it to the island in the sun.
[01:16.25]她会在阳光下的小岛上歇脚
[01:26.97]I will follow in her shadow
[01:26.97]我会紧紧跟在她身后
[01:32.37]As I watch her from my window.
[01:32.37]当我透过窗户窥视着她
[01:33.52]
[01:37.87]One day I will catch her eye.
[01:37.87]有一天我会捕捉到她的眼神
[02:30.17]She is calling from the deep,
[02:30.17]她在地狱深处将我呼唤
[02:35.11]Summoning my soul to endless sleep.
[02:35.11]召唤我的灵魂坠入无尽的沉眠
[02:40.24]She is bound to drag me down,
[02:40.24]她一定会拉我下来
[02:43.90]Drag me down.
[02:43.90]拉我下来
